:10 ); ruin of temple Ezra 9:9 ; = ruined dwellings Psa 109:10 ; compare 2Chr 34:6 , where read perhaps בְּחָרְבֹתֵיהֶם for בתיהם בּחר (see חֶרֶב below III. חרב ); Jer 22:5 ; in General ruins (si vera 1., see Di; object of בנה ) Job 3:14 ; ח ׳כוס Psa 102:7 an owl of a ruin . 2 of land: waste place amid ruins Isa 5:17 , compare 51:3 (|| עֲרָבָה מִדְבָּר, ); land a desolation Jer 7:34 ; 44:22 ; Ezek 25:13 (Edom) Jer 25:11 ; Isa 64:10 and Ezek 33:24 , 27 (of Judah), compare 13:4 , בח ׳כְשֻׁעָלִים simile of the prophets; ׳הח הַשֹּׁמֵמוֺת 36:4 (of Israel); of desolation of enemies of Israel Psa 9:7 ( ׳ח לָנֶ֫צַח ); ׳ח עולם = old ruins Isa 61:4 (with בנה ); elsewhere perpetual ruin, desolation Jer 25:9 ; 49:13 (cities of Bosra); ׳ה מעולם Ezek 26:20 (simile of Tyre).","rootNote":"feminine of 2721 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"Dan 9 2","keyReferences":["Dan 9 2","Ezek 5 14","Ezek 13 4","Ezek 25 13","Ezek 26 20","Ezek 29 9","Ezek 29 10","Ezek 33 24"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":42,"occurrences":[{"reference":"Dan 9 2","book":"Dan","chapter":9,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/חָרְב֥וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfpc"},{"reference":"Ezek 5 14","book":"Ezek","chapter":5,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/חָרְבָּ֣ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 13 4","book":"Ezek","chapter":13,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בָּ/חֳרָב֑וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Ezek 25 13","book":"Ezek","chapter":25,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חָרְבָּה֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 26 20","book":"Ezek","chapter":26,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּ/חֳרָב֤וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"Ezek 29 9","book":"Ezek","chapter":29,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/חָרְבָּ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsa"},{"refer